{"id":"646601","name":"小白菜馄饨","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/646601/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小白菜","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备材料。","img":"images/646601/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉切丁。","img":"images/646601/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小白菜切段。","img":"images/646601/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"小白菜加1勺盐。","img":"images/646601/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"抓匀盐，挤出水。","img":"images/646601/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉搅成馅，加1勺蚝油。","img":"images/646601/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"勺盐。","img":"images/646601/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"勺酱油。","img":"images/646601/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"分次加入葱姜花椒水。","img":"images/646601/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入一个鸡蛋。","img":"images/646601/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"小白菜撰出水，加入肉馅。","img":"images/646601/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"顺时针搅上劲。","img":"images/646601/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"馄饨皮。","img":"images/646601/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"折三折。","img":"images/646601/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"两边对折。","img":"images/646601/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"紫菜香菜打底，加一勺酱油。","img":"images/646601/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"锅中烧开水。","img":"images/646601/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"下入馄饨。","img":"images/646601/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"反复加凉水，煮七八分钟。","img":"images/646601/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"根据自己的口味，加麻油，醋。","img":"images/646601/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}